ing.</p><br><p>A strong gut barrier prevents "leaky gut," where unwanted substances like toxins and bacteria can enter your bloodstream, resulting in inflammation and digestive discomfort.</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="1d49d201-c28a-4cf1-bd42-a4bef68c884a" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1qbkczv"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/creatinediagram.png?v=1739383660&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/creatinediagram.png?v=1739383660&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/creatinediagram.png?v=1739383660&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/creatinediagram.png?v=1739383660" alt="Diagram showing creatine cycle in normal vs. IBD intestines, highlighting energy homeostasis and inflammation." class="r-i52zpc" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="511252aa-e843-4c3b-bd25-0edf5ecc83c7" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" class="r-1tzv1pw"><div data-rid="727c822f-066e-429d-b284-5a51b9fb358d" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1ndubz9"><picture data-rid="eb0ce7f7-98d5-419b-9e9b-6be197b28442" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1rd3snm"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/gettyimages-2153868189-640x640.jpg?v=1739383730" alt="Woman using a foam roller for back exercises in a gym." class="r-1gxijf6" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="f8f2dea4-3ddc-4c13-b4cc-a4e6b295cee8" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-qwokvc"><div data-rid="b2f45929-7b2f-426c-8d8c-e27a14ddfeec" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1xx0guh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>2. Reduces Intestinal Inflammation</p></span></div><div data-rid="ab8ed6bf-fdc6-4d68-8eaf-448a4e5146ff" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1cyiob9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Studies have suggested that creatine has anti-inflammatory properties, which can reduce gut inflammation cause by poor diet, stress, or underlying digestive conditions.</p><br><p>Creatine can support in modulating immune responses and reducing oxidative stress, which is particularly helpful in managing conditions like irritable bowel syndrome (IBS).</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="08019860-996e-427c-b0a1-1dc54289a3cf" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="influencers" tabindex="-1" id="influencers" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-1ihagw8"><div data-rid="5927433c-14d8-43b7-8a19-8bae7db50008" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1w7wwrx"><div data-rid="05726925-1b26-46e1-ab6a-711572eadb1f" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-10h539h alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>3. Enhances Microbial Balance and Reduces Bloating</p></span></div><div data-rid="7473e7e7-7a99-4789-bd8c-79ed6df1dc6a" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-42kp82 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Some studies have shown that improved energy metabolism positively impacts gut microbiomes, contributing to a healthier environment for the good type of bacteria that you actually want in your gut.</p><br><p>This reduces fermentation-related bloating caused by excess gas production caused by harmful bacteria that are overrepresented in an unbalanced gut.</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="ccd68877-b3e3-4aa3-ba01-eaf018d5c468" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1rt0rg2"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/IMG_8297_1_1ed0adc8-cca8-439e-bfd7-22f3ccfa113e.jpg?v=1739383500&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/IMG_8297_1_1ed0adc8-cca8-439e-bfd7-22f3ccfa113e.jpg?v=1739383500&amp;width=1024" media="(min-wi